e microphone dictation and neural text-to-speech spoken audio.'=>'Schakel microfoondicteerfunctie en neurale tekst-naar-spraak in.','Speech-to-Text (Voice Dictation Input)'=>'Spraak-naar-tekst (spraakdicteerinvoer)','Allows guests to speak questions into their browser microphone with live speech recognition.'=>'Stelt gasten in staat vragen in te spreken via hun browsermicrofoon met live spraakherkenning.','Text-to-Speech (Spoken Audio Output)'=>'Tekst-naar-spraak (gesproken audio-uitvoer)','Plays assistant answers aloud using Web Speech API synthesis or ElevenLabs neural voice.'=>'Speelt antwoorden van de assistent hardop af via Web Speech API-synthese of ElevenLabs-neurale stem.','ElevenLabs API Key (Pro High-Fidelity Voice)'=>'ElevenLabs API-sleutel (Pro High-Fidelity-stem)','Optional. When set, uses hyper-realistic ElevenLabs neural voices instead of standard browser synthesis.'=>'Optioneel. Indien ingesteld, worden hyperrealistische neurale stemmen van ElevenLabs gebruikt in plaats van standaardsynthese in de browser.','Page Embedding & Shortcodes Reference'=>'Pagina-insluiting en shortcode-referentie','Embed the AI concierge directly into full-page layouts or custom landing pages.'=>'Sluit de AI-conciërge rechtstreeks in volledige paginalay-outs of aangepaste landingspagina\'s in.','Gutenberg Block'=>'Gutenberg-blok','Search for the "Hotel: AI Concierge" block in the block editor to embed an inline or modal assistant widget anywhere.'=>'Zoek naar het blok "Hotel: AI Concierge" in de blokeditor om overal een ingesloten of modale assistentwidget in te voegen.','Shortcode Snippet'=>'Shortcode-fragment','Supports variant="inline" (embedded in page flow) or variant="floating" (corner bubble).'=>'Ondersteunt variant="inline" (ingebed in paginastroom) of variant="floating" (hoekballon).','Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) & llms.txt'=>'Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) en llms.txt','Publish structured property discovery manifests so AI search engines can cite di